{"id":"c78101abe1090034","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md","title":"Arithmetical Hierarchy","display":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","aliases":["88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy"],"display":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[88-df-decidable-set]]","[[88-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (hierarchy level, including the base index <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\)</span> (decidability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (pairing/tuple code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\Sigma_0^0=\\Pi_0^0=\\Delta_0^0 \\coloneqq \\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}:\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\Sigma_0^0=\\Pi_0^0=\\Delta_0^0 \\coloneqq \\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}:\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Sigma_{n+1}^0 \\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}:\\exists B\\in\\Pi_n^0\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\n(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(\\mathrm{enc}(x,y)\\in B))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Sigma_{n+1}^0 \\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}:\\exists B\\in\\Pi_n^0\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\n(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(\\mathrm{enc}(x,y)\\in B))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Pi_n^0 \\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}:\\mathbb{N}\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\}\n\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\Delta_n^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n^0\\cap\\Pi_n^0\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Pi_n^0 \\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}:\\mathbb{N}\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\}\n\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\Delta_n^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n^0\\cap\\Pi_n^0\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span> = c.e. sets</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_1^0\">\\(\\Delta_1^0\\)</span> = computable sets</li>\n<li>对每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，有\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\\cup\\Pi_n^0\\subseteq\\Delta_{n+1}^0\\subsetneq\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\cup\\Pi_n^0\\subseteq\\Delta_{n+1}^0\\subsetneq\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\)</span>；\n左侧包含在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span>时是等号，而在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>时为真包含。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)$ (decidability predicate, see [[88-df-decidable-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading"